# Research Is Available

When this artifact needs a fact that committed sources — documents, baseline specs, code — cannot
settle (how the live or legacy surface behaves, what a third party does at runtime, what an instance
currently holds), a research capability exists: a subagent investigates and writes a citable
`report.md` under the change's `research/` folder.

Do NOT silently record "not verified" and move on. Name the gap and offer the research; the user
decides whether it runs.

Read [openspec-research](mdc:.cursor/skills/plan/openspec-research/SKILL.md) for the warranted-test
and the procedure — never run one from memory.
